commit bodies: 01faecf inputs: select coordinated workspace runtime

Select the schema-1 coordinator and its shared bounded command runner for
the confctl adapter. Keep runtime and native Codex dependency selections
consistent with the consuming workspace.

c697acc coordination: activate prepared confctl generations

Provide the immutable site adapter for standalone NixOS switches. Prepare
and copy exact generations before claiming a machine, then dry-activate and
publish the system profile while its session owns deployment and review.

Preserve configured auto-rollback and separate live/profile proofs. Retain
ambiguous partial effects for recovery rather than replaying activation.

Initialize the pinned confctl logger for direct library use. Route command
diagnostics through stderr so preparation and activation keep bounded capture
and a complete JSON response on stdout.


