commit bodies: 4ae8cea7 inputs: select coordinated workspace components

Compose the confctl adapter with the reviewed coordinator runtime while
preserving the direct nested runtime selection and unrelated inputs. Match
the host configuration runtime contract to the user-profile application.

2c212466 coordination: route workspace merges and deployments

Map canonical repository targets and aitherdev system/profile activation
into the runtime coordinator. Require prepared approved jobs and durable
machine review ownership while sessions develop independently.

Keep contention inside open agent turns and retain uncertain ownership
through package or lifecycle changes. Existing integration approval and
configuration channel rules still apply.

08115821 coordination: complete the threadless installation through existing workers

The first installation retains a threadless bootstrap owner, so ordinary
session merge admission cannot finish its authorized integration. Provide a
dated, supervised source-only route for that exact installation without
adding permanent bootstrap permissions or a second conversation.

Use the selected runtime's generation and lifecycle admission, snapshots,
approval/submission receipts, claims, merge workers and independent recovery.
Bind successful fix deployment and reviewed feature heads before admission.
Keep the machine reservation and require all other owned operations settled.
Exact retries reuse their bundle and job; unknown effects retain their claim.
The helper is not installed and leaves the application derivation unchanged.


